### jaehoon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jaehoon",
  "password": "jaehoon1234"
}

### 내 알림 목록
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications

### 내 알림 목록 - 두 개씩
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications?limit=2

### 알림 하나를 읽음으로
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications/1/read

### seoyeon으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seoyeon",
  "password": "instagram1234"
}

### seoyeon이 jaehoon의 게시물 1에 좋아요
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/likes/me

### seoyeon이 좋아요 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/likes/me

### seoyeon이 jaehoon의 게시물 1에 댓글
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "여기 어디예요?"
}

### seoyeon이 jaehoon과 doyun을 멘션
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "@jaehoon @doyun 다음 주에 같이 가요"
}

### doyun으로 로그인
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "doyun",
  "password": "instagram1234"
}

### doyun이 jaehoon을 팔로우
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/jaehoon/followers/me

### doyun이 팔로우 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/profiles/jaehoon/followers/me

### seoyeon이 jaehoon의 게시물 14에 좋아요
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/14/likes/me

### seoyeon이 jaehoon의 게시물 26에 좋아요
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/26/likes/me

### seoyeon이 게시물 26의 좋아요를 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/26/likes/me

### seoyeon이 게시물 14에 jaehoon과 doyun을 멘션
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/14/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "@jaehoon @doyun 여기 좋다"
}

### jaehoon이 알림 16을 읽음으로
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications/16/read

### 아직 안 본 알림 수
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications/unseen

### 알림 패널을 열었다
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v2/notifications/seen

### seoyeon이 게시물 14의 좋아요를 취소
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v2/posts/14/likes/me
